# The build context is the repository root. Only the agent image copies from it; the app
# images bind-mount the tree instead. Anything listed here never reaches an image layer.

# Environment files hold local coordinates and throwaway values. A container gets its
# configuration from compose.yaml and its secrets from /run/secrets, never from these.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Dependencies and build output are rebuilt inside the image for its own platform.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
python/.cache

# Test and report output.
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/test-output
**/playwright-report
**/storybook-static
*.lcov

# Repository and editor state.
.git
.husky/_
**/.DS_Store
